{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and take it. Move to destination, check properties, and do specific task finally. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />",
